# The scanned NOH volumes are public domain and tracked; nothing else in
# pdf-source/ is. In particular the Corpus Christi Watershed reference edition
# ("Nova Organi Harmonia - Full PDF.pdf": burned-in branding, a copyrighted
# modern preface) must never be published: tests/test_volumes.py fails if any
# file there but NOH*.pdf is tracked.
pdf-source/*
!pdf-source/NOH*.pdf
vendor/
# ...except the site's own vendored scripts, which the build serves (Exsurge draws
# the chant notation; MIT, see its LICENSE and SOURCE).
!web/public/vendor/
web/.astro/
web/.env.development
web/dist/
web/public/systems
data/index-*.proposed.yml

# Local only: secrets come from 1Password
web/.env
.mcp.json
.dev.vars.example

# D1 exports (npx wrangler d1 export ... --output backups/...): never committed.
workers/*/backups/
